   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p dir=\"ltr\">The error seems clear to me. There is no column named &#39;visit&#39; in data. Use </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">names(data)</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">and </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">str(data)</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">to see what&#39;s in there, and remember that R (unlike SAS) is case sensitive.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best,<br>\r\nIsta</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
